* #variable= 6 #constraint= 3 #equal= 0 intsize= 3 #product= 2 sizeproduct= 5
* nimbus original fixture: two precedence chains x1 <- x2 <- x3 (x2 -> x1, x3 -> x2) and x4 <- x5; x6 free.
